# Building Studio — Registration (Stone Build Mode)

When you **add or change** stone hold-B build mode, placement, snap, preview ghosts, doors, finished materials, or any **`DMBuilding*` / `Assets/_Project/Scripts/Building/`** subsystem with tunable behavior:

## Required (same PR / task as the code change)

1. **Profile-first tunables** — Put adjustable values on durable assets under `Assets/_Project/Resources/Building/` (primary: `DM_BuildingGhostProfile.asset` via `DMBuildingGhostProfile.cs`). Do not leave new magic numbers only in `MonoBehaviour` constants unless they are truly fixed engine limits.
2. **Building Studio** — Extend `Assets/_Project/Editor/Building/DMBuildingStudioWindow.cs` with a labeled section (material slot, color, alpha slider, floats, or object fields) matching the new fields. Group: Preview holograms | Built tints | Snap & grid | Placement | Doors | Finished materials (M key).
3. **Genesis Studio → Building** — Register or extend subtabs in `DMStudioRegistry.cs` and add matching **`DMStudioProfileSectionFilter`** entries in `DMStudioProfileSectionFilter.cs` when the ghost profile gains new field groups.
4. **Runtime reads `DMBuildingGhostProfile.Live`** (or the correct Resources profile) so Play-mode and studio edits apply immediately — same pattern as Genesis Studio profiles.
5. **`playModeSave: true`** on Building profile subtabs in Genesis Studio (already set on ghost profile tabs).

## Placement guide

| Building surface | Studio home |
|------------------|-------------|
| Valid / blocked preview ghost material, color, alpha | **Preview holograms** |
| Finished mesh + window glass tints | **Built tints** |
| Module grid, yaw, height, edge/top snap | **Snap & grid** |
| Hold build/destroy, aim, overlap, door seat | **Placement** |
| Door swing, interact range | **Doors** |
| Stone finishes / M-key cycling | **Finished materials** + `DMBuildingMaterialLibrary` |

## Do not

- Ship new building tuning only on prefab Inspector fields when Building Studio is the design hub for stone mode.
- Add profile fields without updating **both** Building Studio window **and** Genesis Building filtered subtabs (or the external Building Studio link description).
- Forget `.asset` YAML / serialized defaults when adding new profile members.

## Agent checklist (before marking building work done)

- [ ] New tunables on `DMBuildingGhostProfile` or documented Resources asset
- [ ] `DMBuildingStudioWindow` section updated
- [ ] `DMStudioRegistry` + `DMStudioProfileSectionFilter` if profile shape changed
- [ ] Runtime uses `Profile.Live` / static accessors — not duplicate constants
- [ ] User reminded **Ctrl+R** (Auto Refresh off)
